  "$comment": "STU-20 (D117): the trusted sources Ask anything may search. For a profile under 18 only `allow_list` is searched; a learner of 18 or over may switch to the wider web, filtered by `wider_web_excluded`. Configuration owned by the safety lead; these entries are the specification's proposal (open educational resources, encyclopaedias, government health and science agencies, exam boards) until the safety lead signs the list.",
